Chessnut Maia 3 Inference Microservice

This service is the independently deployable AGPL-3.0 boundary for Maia 3
integration. It is intended to be published as open source together with any
Maia 3 engine modifications used by Chessnut.

Upstream Maia 3: https://github.com/CSSLab/maia3
License: GNU Affero General Public License v3.0

The closed-source Chessnut apps and main backend communicate with this service
only through HTTP APIs and must not import this Python package, Maia 3, PyTorch,
or Maia 3 model weights directly.
